{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o090c","title":"袁谭被围遣辛毗请救","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o090c-account","label":"正文","text":"袁谭、袁尚争冀州，袁谭败守平原，遣辛毗向曹操乞降求救；荀攸劝应，曹操回军。","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o059a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"袁谭袁尚相攻谭奔平原遣辛毗求曹操救曹操还黎阳","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o059a-q"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-2a5e61463f8b85dfd40b","label":"正文","text":"袁尚攻袁谭平原袁谭使辛毗求曹操和","evidence":["xinyang-q-d9f6ec16d5796978889b"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-0f67c4a7ad86a53192df","label":"裴注·英雄记","text":"袁谭战败郭图建议求曹并图曹袁谭遣辛毗","evidence":["xinyang-q-c89415e5239c8ec33838"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"求救","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"围攻","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"出使","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0143","role":"劝援","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"回军","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0174","role":"建议","evidence":["xinyang-q-c89415e5239c8ec33838"]}],"place":{"text":"冀州、平原","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安八年","year":203,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o090c-q","wudi-q-o088","wudi-q-b-fa887192716200f6f3cb"],"chronology":"wudi-y203","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o088","basis":"建安八年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,491,"O090c"],"order":212}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0143","name":"荀攸","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0163","name":"袁谭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0174","name":"郭图","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o059a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ad4084dfd65b559ba1b5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖南征荆州。军至西平，谭、尚遂举兵相攻，谭败奔平原。尚攻之急，谭遣辛毗，诣太祖请救。太祖乃还救谭，十月至黎阳。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56},{"id":"wudi-e-o090c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9569c2e9d7bc71b7bd88","layer":"original","quote":"公之去邺而南也，谭、尚争冀州。谭为尚所败，走保平原〖6〗。尚攻之急，谭遣辛毗乞降请救〖7〗。诸将皆疑，荀攸劝公许之；﹝一﹞公乃引军还。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":490,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":111,"end":178},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fa887192716200f6f3cb","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":481,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-09a0cf6c0d76993997e0","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o088","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b55e52dce3d59a3bbee9","layer":"original","quote":"八年春三月〖2〗，攻其郭〖3〗；乃出战。击，大破之，谭、尚夜遁。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":477,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"xinyang-q-c89415e5239c8ec33838","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-0d4bc5347f62e5114dd4","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《英雄记》曰：“谭、尚战于外门，谭军败奔北。郭图说谭曰：‘今将军国小兵少，粮匮势弱；显甫之来，久则不敌。愚以为可呼曹公来击显甫。曹公至，必先攻邺，显甫还救；将军引兵而西，自邺以北皆可虏得。若显甫军破，其兵奔亡，又可敛取以拒曹公；曹公远侨而来，粮饷不继，必自逃去。比此之际，赵国以北皆我之有，亦足与曹公为对矣。不然，不谐！’谭始不纳，后遂从之。问图：‘谁可使？’图答：‘辛佐治可。’谭遂遣毗诣太祖。”","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-51ccf0b87f5dceb0f626","start":0,"end":202},{"id":"xinyang-q-d9f6ec16d5796978889b","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-a4e72349e106ad932833","layer":"original","quote":"及袁尚攻兄谭于平原〖2〗，谭使毗诣太祖求和〖3〗。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":52,"end":77}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
